questions.scenario:
You are debugging a production issue where a Spring component hangs indefinitely under high concurrent traffic. A developer implemented a hierarchical computation cache using `ConcurrentHashMap` as shown below:

java
@Component
public class DependencyResolver {
    private final ConcurrentHashMap<String, String> cache = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();

    public String getOrCompute(String taskId) {
        return cache.computeIfAbsent(taskId, key -> {
            if (key.startsWith("SUB_")) {
                return "COMPUTED_SUBTASK";
            }
            // Recursive computeIfAbsent call on the same ConcurrentHashMap instance
            return cache.computeIfAbsent("SUB_" + key, subKey -> "COMPUTED_" + subKey);
        });
    }
}
